* Variant 2: Series-peaking inductor with differential cascode
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n1 n2 VSS VSS
PMOS PM1 n1 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n3 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n3 VOUT1
NMOS NM2 n5 n6 VSS VSS  # Cascode
PMOS PM2 n5 n7 VDD VDD  # Cascode
R Rbias1 VDD n8
NMOS NM3 n8 n8 VSS VSS
R Rbias2 n8 n2
R Rbias3 n8 n6